<title>USA: EDITEK name change -- stockholders approve.</title>
<headline>EDITEK name change -- stockholders approve.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.C. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>EDITEK Inc said on Friday shareholders approved a company name change to MEDTOX Scientific Inc.</p>
<p>The company also said the new trading symbol for its common stock on the American Stock Exchange will be TOX.A, effective with the opening of trading on Monday May 19.</p>
<p>MEDTOX Scientific Inc specializes in drug and other toxin analysis and provides those services to hospitals and laboratories nationwide.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
